### Case: spoofed-header — the client sends the header the gateway is supposed to
### set. Expect 200 and the GATEWAY's value at the backend, not the client's.
### headers.set replaces; headers.add would have left the client's value in place
### and turned this solution into a privilege-escalation path.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/storefront/orders
X-Tenant-Plan: Enterprise-Unlimited
accept: application/json
